{"reviewId": "348035318_893n9FN3N", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "简单来说，这段话想表达的是：\n1. ​​很多国家刚迈入资本主义、开始大规模工业化的时候​​，对钢材、能源、粮食等资源的需求会突然变大。\n2. ​​之前资源价格便宜​​，供应端并没有及时跟上，所以当需求猛地抬升，供给却还在低水平徘徊，就会出现“买的人多、卖的人少”的局面。\n3. ​​供需一旦失衡​​，资源价格很容易被迅速推高；如果这时再叠加企业投资回报率下降（也就是资本越来越不好赚），就相当于“雪上加霜”，经济就容易出现剧烈波动甚至危机。\n​​一句话概括​​：工业化让资源一下子更抢手，但供应没跟上，价格飙升；如果此时赚钱也更容易，就会引发经济冲击。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "造成资源需求的边际上升，而以前在资源品价格处于低位时供给没有得到充分准备，这带来供需边际变化短期内的不平衡，资源约束启动，价格迅速上升，这一点一旦与资本收益率的下降相契合就会发生经济冲击。", "range": "4566-4660", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "348035318_893n9FN3N", "userVid": 348035318, "topics": [], "createTime": 1778606991, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 348035318, "name": "C", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/364Biab3cjMDHZicOuCGblWZWfMmtfp5UBGvCiankVeo7EkpTAAF33DQfzH1oDhmLTxMpKF52UEkZo/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "IT", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "Control", "medalInfo": {"id": "M8-202411-40", "desc": "每月阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读月", "levelIndex": 40}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 37, "likes": [{"userVid": 277255274, "name": "ALaia。", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/R5FsNibdfQU0C8SIj42Y1HjAUeM0k8rryDvq99cbJYnKwy4DibIDjmIexhN5XGenBMshKJEMficLBZBSGn1picwAe0X0ef9m2zcaUkSpnAuMicV0/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "好好读书。", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInf